<report>
<title>Incidence rate ratio (IRR) meta-analysis</title>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th colspan="4">Table (a, person-time exposed, b, person-time not exposed)</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="inputs"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@a</td><td>@{pt1:roundu}</td><td>@b</td><td>@{pt2:roundu}</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>IRR</th><th colspan="2"><ci>@pc% CI (exact)</ci></th><th></th></tr>
<block name="ir"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{irr:roundu}</td><td><ci>@{lci:roundu}</ci></td><td><ci>@{uci:roundu}</ci></td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><th colspan="2">% Weights (fixed, random)</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="ir"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{yi:roundu}</td><td>@{vi:roundu}</td><td>@wt</td><td>@dwt</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<p><u>Fixed effects (inverse variance)</u><br />
Pooled IRR = @{rmh:roundu} (<ci>@pc% CI = @{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu}</ci>)<br />
Z (test IRR differs from 1) = @{z:roundu}  <pval>@{p_z:pval}</pval></p>
<block name="poolok">

<p>Fixed effects (conditional maximum likelihood)<br />
Pooled rate ratio = @{eor:roundu}<br />
<ci>Exact Fisher @pc% confidence interval = @{llf:roundu} to @{ulf:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided @{p1f:pval}, two sided @{p2f:pval}</pval><br />
<ci>Exact mid-P @pc% confidence interval = @{llm:roundu} to @{ulm:roundu}</ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided @{p1m:pval}, two sided @{p2m:pval}</pval></p>
</block>

<p><u>Non-combinability of studies</u><br />
Cohran Q = @{qc:roundu}  (df = @df) <pval>@{xp:pval}</pval><br />
Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = @{tausq:roundu}<br />
I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = @isq% (<ci>@pc1% CI = @llisq% to @ulisq%</ci>) </p>

<p><u>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</u><br />
Pooled IRR = @{dsirr:roundu} (<ci>@pc% CI = @{dsll:roundu} to @{dsul:roundu}</ci>)<br />
Z (test IRR differs from 1) = @{dz:roundu}  <pval>@{dp:pval}</pval></p>
<block name="egger">

<p><u>Bias indicators</u><br />
Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's @tau  <pval>@{p2:pval}</pval><br />
Egger: bias = @a (<ci>@pc_egger% CI = @cl to @cu</ci>)  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
</report>
